---
name: sanity-run-table
version: 1.1.0
description: Compact sanity-run history table. Input runs are newest-first.
format: markdown
required_variables:
  - runs
---
| Sprint | PR | Iter | Result | Done | Find |
|:--|:--|--:|:--:|:--|--:|
{% for run in runs %}| {{ run.sprint }} | #{{ run.pr_number }} | {{ run.iteration }} | {% if run.verdict == "PASS" %}✅{% else %}❌{% endif %} | {{ run.completed_local }} · {{ run.duration }} | {{ run.findings }} |
{% endfor %}
